node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
dist/

# SwiftPM build output, and the assembled .app: artifacts, like dist/
#
# `*.app/` is not redundant with `swift/.build/`, which is where build.sh puts the
# bundle today. It is there because the comment claimed the .app was covered and
# only the build directory was — and the one leak this file exists to prevent was
# 222MB of exactly this kind of output, committed because nothing refused it.
swift/.build/
*.app/
